Package: oomcp
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign Model Context Protocol composite gateway and tool router
 A sovereign Model Context Protocol (MCP) composite gateway and tool
 router written in pure openOODA. It aggregates all installed openOODA userland
 tools into a unified JSON-RPC 2.0 stdio server, provides dynamic tool discovery,
 and dispatches capability-bounded tool calls for AI coding agents.
